      "writtenOn": "2021-08-02T06:39:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is used to filter out the tachometer underflow information by the log level setting(https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/third_party/zephyr/+/refs/heads/chromeos-v2.6/drivers/sensor/nuvoton_tach_npcx/tach_nuvoton_npcx.c#266). When EC is power-on, there is no edge on the pin of the tachometer until the fan is triggered. It makes the console fill with `TACH_1 is underflow!`. We do not always connect a fan on our evb, so we prefer default doesn\u0027t display it. For original ecos, this is also blocked by `DEBUG_FAN`.",
